nt-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">GOODS_CARTS_CLICK</code>：商品互动-购物车点击</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-CirbVH2n\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">GOODS_CARTS_ORDER</code>：商品互动-购物车下单</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-B6MQM6jw\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">LIVE_WATCH</code>：直播互动-观看</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AetGQzQs\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">LIVE_COMMENT</code>：直播互动-直播评论</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-40bqzt0d\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">LIVE_EFFECTIVE_WATCH</code>：直播互动-有效观看</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-fUTm7Uwx\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">LIVE_EXCEPTIONAL</code>：直播互动-打赏</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AHv3jPax\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">LIVE_GOODS_CLICK</code>：直播互动-商品点击</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-pCZcGTvC\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius